\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {11}{\ignorespaces \centering  Performance Comparison Graph  This performance comparison graph illustrates the trade-off between detection accuracy (COCO mAP@0.5) and inference latency (ms/img) for various YOLO-based models and other architectures on a T4 TensorRT platform. The curve for YOLOv11 demonstrates it achieves high accuracy with low latency, outperforming earlier YOLO versions and alternative models.}}{24}{figure.caption.23}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:performance_comparison_graph}{{11}{24}{\centering Performance Comparison Graph\\ This performance comparison graph illustrates the trade-off between detection accuracy (COCO mAP@0.5) and inference latency (ms/img) for various YOLO-based models and other architectures on a T4 TensorRT platform. The curve for YOLOv11 demonstrates it achieves high accuracy with low latency, outperforming earlier YOLO versions and alternative models}{figure.caption.23}{}}
